  "generatedAt": "2026-09-16T11:15:32.655Z",
  "summary": "## HubSpot Meetings API Toolkit\n\nProvides LLM access to the HubSpot Meetings API, enabling agents to discover, configure, and book meetings directly through HubSpot's scheduling and calendar integration.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- **Discovery & configuration**: List all meeting scheduling pages and retrieve scheduler setup details needed before booking.\n- **Availability checking**: Fetch upcoming open time slots for any meeting page by slug.\n- **Meeting booking & scheduling**: Book meetings via HubSpot's native scheduling feature or schedule through HubSpot's external calendar integration; both operations use a schema-first pattern (fetch schema once, then execute) to construct the required request body.\n\n## OAuth\n\nThis toolkit authenticates via OAuth 2.0 using HubSpot as the provider. See the [HubSpot auth provider docs](https://docs.arcade.dev/en/references/auth-providers/hubspot) for setup details."
